    "summary": "t7 verdict fixes landed @dc29b3f2d: new vscode-free chat/scratch-host.ts owns the six scratch intents over injected boundaries (executable in tests); extension.ts builds the scratch store directly after createAttachmentStore at ~/.insrc/scratches, uses the showInputBox boundary via promptTitle, routes the six intents through SCRATCH_INTENT_TYPES in the wrapped chat channel, and send-to-chat opens the chat before the disposed check then awaits ready and pushes the capped insert-into-input. Non-string ids/texts are runtime-rejected with a warn. The four PLAN-named tests now execute the real createScratchHost over fakes (cancel/blank/answer flows, error+recovery, reveal/ready/cap/disposed ordering, 65,536-byte cap, malformed fields) — 39/39 wiring+scratch-panel pass, 6/6 t4 chat tests, tsc clean.",
